#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#The parameter p_usg is the linear range understeer gradient for the vehicle being tested.
#
#You should run an understeer test to determine an appropriate value for any vehicle that will use this controller.
#
#You may also need to adjust the controller gain (p_esc_kp). Heavier vehicles or vehicles with smaller brakes may need higher values.
#
#The link at the bottom causes VS Visualizer to show an ESC alert icon when the output variable esc_icon (defined in this dataset) is nonzero.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

